{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 多智能体系统MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent间通信机制\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/多智能体\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Agent间通信机制\" dir=\"auto\">Agent间通信机制</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 问题\" dir=\"auto\">1. 问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明多智能体系统中Agent之间的通信机制，包括直接通信、间接通信、共享内存等模式，以及各自的优缺点和适用场景。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1.1.1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1.1.1. 答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Agent间通信的分类</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent间通信是MAS的核心基础设施，决定了信息如何在Agent之间流动。通信方式分为两大类：直接通信和间接通信。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>1. 直接通信（Direct Communication）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent之间直接交换消息，点对点或广播。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>消息传递</strong></td>\n<td>Agent A向Agent B发送结构化消息</td>\n<td>直接、明确、可追溯</td>\n<td>耦合度高，需要知道接收方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>群聊（GroupChat）</strong></td>\n<td>多个Agent在共享对话中发言</td>\n<td>灵活、自然、支持涌现</td>\n<td>Token消耗高、可能混乱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>RPC/HTTP调用</strong></td>\n<td>Agent A通过API调用Agent B</td>\n<td>标准化、跨语言、可扩展</td>\n<td>延迟、网络依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2. 间接通信（Indirect Communication）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent通过共享介质交换信息，无需直接交互。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>共享内存/黑板</strong></td>\n<td>所有Agent读写同一块共享区域</td>\n<td>松耦合、信息持久化</td>\n<td>并发冲突、数据一致性问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>消息队列</strong></td>\n<td>通过Kafka/RabbitMQ等中间件</td>\n<td>异步、可靠、可扩展</td>\n<td>系统复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>向量数据库</strong></td>\n<td>Agent将信息Embedding存入向量库</td>\n<td>语义检索、长期记忆</td>\n<td>检索精度依赖Embedding质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>3. 黑板模式（Blackboard Pattern）详解</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">黑板模式是MAS中最重要的间接通信模式之一，所有Agent读写同一个共享内存区。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 黑板模式实现示例</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Any<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> List\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> threading\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Blackboard</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"共享黑板——所有Agent的公共工作区\"\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_data<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Any<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_lock <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> threading<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Lock<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_subscribers<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">callable</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">write</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> value<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Any<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Agent向黑板写入信息\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_lock<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> key <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_data<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_data<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_data<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"value\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> value<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"agent\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> agent_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 通知订阅者</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_notify<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> value<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">read</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Any<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Agent从黑板读取信息\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_lock<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_data<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">subscribe</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> callback<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">callable</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"订阅特定key的更新\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> key <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_subscribers<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_subscribers<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_subscribers<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>callback<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 使用示例</span>\nblackboard <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Blackboard<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Agent A写入研究结果</span>\nblackboard<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>write<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"research_result\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"AI Agent市场增长50%\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent_id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"researcher\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Agent B读取并继续工作</span>\nresults <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> blackboard<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>read<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"research_result\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 基于研究结果撰写文章</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2026年的技术演进——向量黑板：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">传统黑板通常是结构化数据库或内存对象，现在的\"黑板\"进化为长短期记忆混合的向量库：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">Agent A将其推理过程和中间结果Embedding后存入向量库</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">Agent B在执行相关任务时，通过语义检索自动获取A的上下文</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">即使Agent A已经销毁，其贡献的知识依然留存，供后续Agent复用</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：基于向量数据库的黑板</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vectorstores <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Chroma\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embeddings <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> OpenAIEmbeddings\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">VectorBlackboard</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"基于向量数据库的语义黑板\"\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embeddings <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> OpenAIEmbeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vectorstore <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Chroma<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>embedding_function<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">contribute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> content<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> metadata<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Agent贡献知识到黑板\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vectorstore<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_texts<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            texts<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            metadatas<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"agent\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> agent_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token operator\">**</span>metadata<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">query</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"语义检索黑板内容\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vectorstore<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>similarity_search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>k<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Agent A贡献知识</span>\nboard <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> VectorBlackboard<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nboard<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>contribute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"AI Agent市场规模预计2026年达到100亿美元\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"market_researcher\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Agent B通过语义检索获取相关知识（不需要知道A的存在）</span>\ninsights <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> board<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"AI Agent市场趋势\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1.1.2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">1.1.2. 延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：LLM Agent之间的通信与传统分布式系统通信有何不同？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：LLM Agent通信内容主要是自然语言或结构化Prompt，而非二进制数据；通信模式更偏向\"对话\"和\"协作推理\"；通信协议需要支持语义理解（如A2A），而非单纯的RPC。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：如何设计Agent间通信的安全机制？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：采用零信任架构，每次通信验证身份；最小权限原则，Agent只能访问必要的通信通道；通信内容加密；审计日志记录所有通信；Guardrails AI进行Input/Output扫描。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"1.1.3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">1.1.3. 常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：Agent间通信越频繁越好。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：过度通信会导致Token成本激增和上下文膨胀。应该设计合理的通信粒度，重要信息才共享，非关键中间结果可以省略。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">2. 相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}